OL,3,GNEWSA'We're inundated' - Glasgow's
OL,4,Astruggle to house the homeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FScott Crean is living out of a
OL,7,Fsuitcase.
OL,9,FHe's been homeless for the last year -
OL,10,Fand since Christmas has been staying in
OL,11,Fa hotel room in Glasgow.
OL,13,FIn September 2025, the 37-year-old was
OL,14,Famong a record number people who were
OL,15,Fstuck in temporary accommodation in
OL,16,FGlasgow and across Scotland.
OL,18,FNow the latest figures are set to be
OL,19,Freleased amid fears that the problem is
OL,20,Fcontinuing to get worse.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
